igrep -- emulates UNIX egrep
Usage: igrep -Options [expression] filename...
  Options:
  c   print count of matching lines rather than actual lines
  h   don't display file names
  i   ignore case of letters
  l   list only the names of files containing matching lines
  n   precede lines with line numbers
  s   work silently -- display nothing
  v   invert search to display only lines that don't match
  e expr  useful if expressions starts with -
  E expr  expresson containing Icon escape sequences
  f file  take list of alternated expressions from "file"